        "2916552a-4524-4aff-acbc-634e4afb6d00": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Notre Dame de Marceille",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>As our journey commences, we will join in ceremony, connecting to the Spirit of Place, the Ancestors and the Magdalene Energy, asking for a blessing both individually and collectively for our Pilgrimage. Here we learn of local legends hidden in its gorgeous artwork. Among the statues are a very beautiful and unique Mary Magdalene and a Black Madonna. Historians believe the basilica stands on the location of an old Roman temple dedicated to Mars, but the presence of two wells may indicate that it was actually dedicated to the Mother Goddess, like the very popular Roman goddess Diana or even Isis, the Egyptian goddess who became popular throughout the Roman empire in the 1st century AD.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/SF-Sacred-Journey-Notre-Dame-De-Marceille_025119b7-8abd-49fb-9ef4-0af5d5af91c5.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "aaa35b1a-8f7f-40b4-88b2-307c26dd6c43": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Magdala Tower",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We will visit the museum, the church dedicated to Mary Magdalene that is at the heart of the Rennes-le-Chateau mystery, the Magdala Tower, and we’ll also see the medieval castle that still stands at the heart of the village. Taking time to meditate in Mary Magdeline’s church, we reach for deeper understanding of the mysteries that surround Rennes-le-Chateau.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/SF-Sacred-Journey-Magdalena-Tower-Rennes-Le-Chateau_a8f3b753-9f22-4679-a17e-27c920d93fd9.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "643bace9-4996-4be4-b931-2de728a157a3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Canallettes Caves",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>In the fortified town of Villefranche de Conflent, we will visit the stunning ‘Underground Versaille’, the Canallettes Caves, just outside of Villefranche de Conflent. Having the opportunity to enter a sacred cave gives us the opportunity to experience a connection with Gaia in a meaningful way.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/SF-Sacred-Journey-The-Caves-Of-Les-Grandes-Canalettes_1271387f-1436-42f8-a041-5bf006987707.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "cab40b70-71f5-4157-900c-344ccf2d5e06": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Templar Castle",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We will visit its ancient and massive Templar Castle, built in 1207 and expanded over several centuries. We’ll visit the castle in the morning and then have free time to have lunch at a cafe by the Mediterranean Sea, explore this beautiful town and shop in the fun French boutiques.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/SF-Sacred-Journey-Templar-Castle-Chateau-Royal-De-Collioure_47b0d59c-8401-4645-a085-d2ee3a08be3c.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        }
