    "5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>\"The Tour was a deeply moving and very wonderful trip. I felt so connected to the Earth and the sacred sites we visited.The weather was perfect, the agenda was extremely well planned, the group was wonderful, our accommodations were outstanding and the food was fantastic.It was easy to drop into a very deep feeling of peace and connection to the land and the people when we were so extremely well cared for.  It turned out even better than I could have ever imagined.Thank you so much for your great expertise in putting trips together, and for your calm disposition in meeting the unexpected challenges that such a trip can present.\"</p>",
            "author": "Connie S.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "899314c4-90a9-4ace-b175-23f42f03347c": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>\"Thanks so much for a wonderful week. Tina and I have been to many events and conferences your company organized. This was our first tour/excursion and it greatly exceeded our expectations. The beauty of the land has to be seen to be fully appreciated. We so appreciate all we learned so much from the guides who live there and led our daily tours. But the outdoor meditations with the beautiful backdrops were a new and profound experience. Topping all of this off was the joy of spending the week with our tour group. With each day and experience, the love of family grew and became more powerful. We will never forget this!”</p>",
            "author": "Steve K.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>\"Your tours are my FAVORITE!!! You are a wonderful tour organizer, taking such good care of ALL of us and making the tours soooooo special. I will never forget the special, wonderful time we had on the tour. Thanks so much. We were all blessed to have you as the tour leader. Awesome job.\"</p>",
            "author": "Jackie T.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "30ee8aed-c331-49b8-a501-04a969da42bf": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>\"Don and I wish to express to you our deepest heartfelt gratitude for your superb leadership in organizing a magnificent spiritual pilgrimage. Thank you for your care, kindness and attentiveness to all our needs. We truly had a life-changing experience on your beautiful tour. We are so blessed to have gotten to go with you on this beautiful and profound journey.\"</p>",
            "author": "Anna & Don S.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“The accommodations in Giza and Luxor exceeded all our expectations! The food was fabulous.”</p>",
            "author": "Carmen S.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“The trip was life changing for me... it was a spiritual calling to be there and the entire experience, people included, was ineffable from start to finish. Life will never be the same for me.”</p>",
            "author": "James C. ",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
