    "05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What accommodations should I expect?",
            "text": "<p>During your Peru and Bolivia trip, you can expect tried and tested excellent 4 - 5-star accommodations every night of your trip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What's the difference between Double and Single?",
            "text": "<p>Single occupancy means you will have your own room for all accommodations during the trip. Double occupancy means you will share a room with someone you plan to share the room with. Double occupancy rooms have two options: a shared bed or a room with two separate beds. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Do I need to have a vaccine to travel to Peru and Bolivia?",
            "text": "<p>You may need a yellow fever vaccine to enter Bolivia, depending on your country of origin.<br/><br/>For more information, visit: <a href=\"https://www.passporthealthusa.com/destinationadvice/bolivia/#vaccines\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.passporthealthusa.com/destinationadvice/bolivia/#vaccines\">Passport Health: Yellow Fever Vaccinations.</a> <a href=\"https://www.passporthealthusa.com/destination-advice/bolivia/#vaccines\" target=\"_blank\"><br/><br/></a>Stay updated on current travel requirements, as they may change due to evolving public health conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-5": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Do you cater for Vegetarians or Vegans?",
            "text": "<p>Peru is known for its cuisine and excellent restaurants enjoyed by foodies. The restaurants we will visit will serve a variety of Peruvian, Bolivian and Western dishes with plenty of vegetarian options and some vegan options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-7": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What service can I expect when traveling with Jorge Delgado owner and founder of Kontiki Peru Tours.",
            "text": "<p>For 30 years Jorge Luis Delgado’s award-winning tour company Kontiki Tours has been leading people on memorable Andean journeys. You can expect a professional team with a high level of experience in the field of tourism and touring.  “We treat our clients with dedication and do our best for them to have unique and memorable experiences in our country. With Kontiki Tours you will have security, confidence and personalized attention, with guarantees that you, our clients deserve. We base our services in Munay, Llancay and Yachay (service, love and wisdom) as our ancient fathers based their lives.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
